,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-07-10T00:55:58Z","updated_at":"2025-07-14T15:35:00Z","closed_at":"2025-07-14T15:35:00Z","assignee":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.5.beta3.official [4d1f26e1f], v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta3 - Windows 11 (build 22621) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 Ti Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6636) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-12900H (20 threads) - 31.69 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn _Jolt Physics_, a sleeping `RigidBody3D` will not wake when another moving `RigidBody3D` is nearby. This causes the first contact to be non-existent. In _GodotPhysics3D_, the sleeping `RigidBody3D` will wake when another moving `RigidBody3D` is nearby (I'm assuming, I don't know if it's distance based), and thus the first contact will be reported. Note that the collision behavior still occurs in that the objects move, but the first contact in _Jolt Physics_ isn't reported.\n\nFor clarification, \"first contact\" in _Jolt Physics_ refers to the contact information that is lost due to the hit `RigidBody3D` being asleep. The MRP is set up such that only one contact will occur.\n\nI would expect the collision to always report a contact, regardless of the _Physics Engine_ set. As for the waking up of the `RigidBody3D`, I wouldn't necessarily expect it to wake up based on proximity, unless that is required for my expected behavior.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Run Project\n2. Ensure _Jolt Physics_ is set for _Physics Engine_\n3. Hold \"w\" or \"up arrow\"\n4. Wait until `Cube` and `Pusher` collide\n5. Note how `There was a contact!` is never printed to the console\n6. Ensure _GodotPhysics3D_ is set for _Physics Engine_\n7. Hold \"w\" or \"up arrow\"\n8. Wait until `Cube` and `Pusher` collide\n9. Note how `There was a contact!` is now printed to the console\n10. Also note how the cube woke up due to `Pusher` moving\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[jolt_sleep_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21151896/jolt_sleep_mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108462/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108462/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}